### Go template
# Binaries for programs and plugins
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib

# Test binary, built with `go test -c`
*.test

# Output of the go coverage tool, specifically when used with LiteIDE
*.out

# Dependency directories (remove the comment below to include it)
# vendor/

# envs
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
*.pem
*.key
secrets.json
credentials.json

# user's
notes/

# Agents and spec artefacts — deliberately untracked so they can never enter the published
# module zip (FR-033, NFR-008, SC-006). git archive only archives tracked files, so untracked
# is the whole mechanism: no marker modules, no packaging step, no CI gate.
.specify/
.opencode/
specs/
docs/

.pnpm-debug.log

# thrash
.DS_Store
.idea
